  "description": "They’re not just growing up – they’re ready for a bike that can keep up. Dart Plus helps kids explore farther and ride with more confidence by introducing them to some of the tools they’ll find on their first adult bike. A 40mm suspension fork and Shimano 7-speed drivetrain offer more comfort for them to go-go-go, and reliable front & rear Tektro mechanical disc brakes give them the power to stop on a dime. The lightweight, ergonomic frame was designed with kid-sized proportions in mind, so they can stay comfortable and maneuver their bike with ease as they explore. Growth spurts are inevitable, but with a seat, handlebars, and brake levers that adjust for the perfect fit, this kids bike is ready to grow right along with them. With Dart Plus, your big kid will be ready for wherever their curiosity takes them.",
